WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:00.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Thank you.

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, man, thank you,
thank you, thank you.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:07.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so happy to be here
and not at home with my wife.

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.910 line:92%
Yeah, yeah, I like to miss her.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
Actually I love --
I love to miss her...

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.217 size:75% position:38% line:92%
a lot, a lot, a lot.

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:17.784 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah. Yeah, yeah.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:20.653
She's, you know, you could hear
it in my voice.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.588 line:92%
A lot of you picked up in it.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This guy's married."
You can hear it, you know?

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a little essence
of defeat

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.762 line:92%
every time I open my mouth.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
15 years, man.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.299 line:92%
15 years in the same spot.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.336 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.671 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughing ]

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.206 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.074 size:78% position:39% line:92%
She's my best friend.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:43.376 line:92%
♪♪ She's my best friend ♪♪

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:47.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is she? Is she my best friend?
Is she?

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
Jason.
Jason was my best friend.

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:55.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
I haven't seen Jason
in 15 years.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:56.056 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
15...

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
I should give him a call.
Hey, buddy.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
15 years.
Don't get it twisted, guys.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love her.
I love this woman.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:07.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's changed me.
I'm not the same dude anymore.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.967 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm not.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I-I care now.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.938 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Ugh.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:12.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I...[Laughs]

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
I care. I care so much!
I care.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:19.813
I care about stuff I never cared
about before, like sunny days.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:21.081 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I like sunny days now.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:22.115 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Yeah. It's a sunny day.

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:24.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
We should go outside
and do something.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:27.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like I've said that out loud
as a man.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.989 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
Cats.
I like cats now.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:39.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's new.
Yeah, that's new.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:41.468 line:92%
I was a dog guy my whole life.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:45.371
I used to think that cats
were really fancy squirrels

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.173 line:92%
that hung around outside.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meow?
That's a fancy squirrel.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:50.443 size:88% position:44% line:92%
We should invite him in.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.179 size:84% position:42%
It sounds like he wears
a top hat and a scarf.

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.814 line:92%
I want to hear his story.

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:55.882 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That one probably has

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
a delightful British accent,
right?

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.820 size:84% position:42%
Here's the one where
I lose a lot of people.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sports.
I'm not into sports anymore.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:04.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
All right.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.359 line:92%
You don't need to join me.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.361 line:92%
But it was by accident, right?

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.529 line:92%
I was watching a football game,

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I hit "previous channel"
on the remote.

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then it jumped to a whole
nother channel

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:17.770 size:84% position:42%
and then that's when
I discovered this HGTV.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:18.972 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:21.141 line:92%
Oh, you guys are aware of it?

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:24.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
What? You've seen this Home
and Garden Network?

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:27.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, what a delightful network
that is.

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:30.049 size:84% position:42%
I missed the whole game
because I got caught up

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a marathon
of "Property Brothers,"

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.520 line:92%
"Flip or Flop," "House Hunters."

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:37.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was yelling at the TV
like it was a football game.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.559 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Get the marble counters!

00:02:39.559 --> 00:02:41.561 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:45.965 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
No! No!

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:49.802
Not those cabinets, that's not
going to add property value!

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
What are we doing, team?
What are we doing?

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:56.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pick number two,
it has a finished basement!

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.578 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:02.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm passionate.
I'm passionate.

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:03.383 line:92%
And then, if you watch HGTV,

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:06.686
you know their crown jewel,
that "Fixer Upper" show?

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.354 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, again, yeah.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:11.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
With Joanna and Chip
in Waco, Texas?

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:12.091 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What?

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:13.193 line:92%
First of all, first of all,

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:15.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can buy a house
for $5 in Waco, Texas...

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.063 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:19.532
...according to Joanna and Chip,
right?

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:20.800 line:92%
Joanna is exotic-looking.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.734 line:92%
You don't know what she is.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:24.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chip is this funny white guy
that can fix anything

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
and makes me giggle
every episode.

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:27.740 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
Get off that tree, Chip.
You're gonna break something.

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:33.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:37.850
I feel -- I feel the way the men
are looking at me,

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.286 line:92%
like, "Oh, this one is suspect."

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:40.853 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I feel suspect.

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:44.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went on Google and started
asking questions.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.926 line:92%
Do I have low "T," right?

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:49.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. I had to answer
some questions.

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:51.831 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Do you like iced lattes?

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:53.166 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yes.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.034 line:92%
Do you enjoy Sunday brunch?

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
On a sunny day?
Yes.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.471 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:04:03.176 --> 00:04:07.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you watch more than 17
cat videos in a week?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
Only way to start the morning.
Yes.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.986 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:14.754 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Go see your doctor.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:16.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go see my doctor.
I got tested.

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:19.425
Came back.
All my levels are normal, right?

00:04:19.425 --> 00:04:20.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
Come back.
Tell my lady.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, babe, I don't know
what's going on.

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:27.133
The doctor says I'm fine, but I
cried at the end of 'Coco.'"

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.434 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:29.769 line:92%
That movie snuck up on me.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:33.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
She tells me, "Babe,
just be proud of yourself

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.708 line:92%
because I'm proud of you.

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.910 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You're just evolving."

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.412 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:41.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
Evolving?
Evolving.

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:43.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't like that word.
Evolving.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.285 line:92%
I don't think I'm evolving.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:48.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just think you're murdering
the man I used to be

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:48.988 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
every night.

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:50.523 line:92%
You say it's sleep apnea,

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:53.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I clearly see a pillow
coming off of my face.

00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:55.295 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:55.295 --> 00:04:58.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much.
My name's Orlanda Leyba.

00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.199 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm humbled.

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:06.539 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:08.174 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Orlando Leyba!

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:08.908 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:15.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
Check out his special
on HBO Latino November 16th.

